course: dictionary
lesson: 16040
title: Veterinary: care for animals
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Veterinary is an adjective, so it describes a noun. It tells you the thing is to do with the medical care and treatment of animals. «The veterinary clinic was busy on Saturday morning.» A clinic is a place for treatment, and veterinary tells you this clinic is for animals, not people.
explain: Look at the words around it for clues. «Mum took our sick cat to the veterinary surgery, and the surgeon gave it medicine.» Sick cat, surgery and medicine all point to animal health. So veterinary must mean for animals' medical care.
explain: Ask yourself: what word would fit here? Then swap in your meaning to check. «The animal doctor» fits in place of veterinary surgeon, so your meaning is right.
fact: Veterinary means to do with the medical care and treatment of animals.
fact: Veterinary is an adjective: it describes a noun, such as a veterinary clinic.
fact: A veterinary surgeon is a doctor who treats animals (UK).
fact: A veterinary nurse helps look after sick or hurt animals.
fact: Veterinary medicine is the study and practice of animal health.
exercise: «The veterinary clinic was busy on Saturday morning.» What does veterinary mean here? | *To do with medical care for animals | To do with shopping for food | To do with sports and games | To do with reading and writing
exercise: «Ella wants to be a veterinary nurse when she grows up.» Find and copy one word that describes the nurse's job. | *veterinary | Ella | grows | wants
exercise: Mum said the veterinary surgeon would check the rabbit's teeth. What is a veterinary surgeon? | *A doctor who treats animals | A teacher who teaches maths | A driver of buses | A person who cuts hair
test: «Our dog had a hurt paw, so we went to the veterinary surgery.» What is the best meaning of veterinary here? | For cleaning houses | For cooking dinner | For people's medical care | *For animals' medical care
test: What does veterinary medicine mean? | Medicine that tastes nice | Medicine for children | *The study and practice of animal health | Medicine for plants
exam: Mia says a veterinary nurse works in a bank. What does veterinary nurse really mean? | *A nurse who helps care for sick or hurt animals | A nurse who cleans the sea | A nurse who works in a bank | A nurse for plants
